                                                 "Description": "The Fire Barge is an alteration on the Barge’s design, trading its stellar defenses for speed and frightening, single use offense. With a nuclear payload on board, it makes a great last resort against high value targets or large swarms of enemies. Take care that our other units don’t get caught in the blast.",
                                                 "CodexDescription": "The Fire Barge is an alteration on the Barge’s design, trading its stellar defenses for speed and frightening, single use offense. With a nuclear payload on board, it makes a great last resort against high value targets or large swarms of enemies. Take care that our other units don’t get caught in the blast.

Strategy
Fire Barge explosions have a wide radius and obliterate anything in their path. This means a well placed Fire Barge can cripple the enemy fleet, and a poorly placed one can cripple ours.

Lore
When an AI was tasked with the most efficient method to eliminate enemy fleets, it provided a similar design to the Fire Barge. It was initially denied due to high material cost and endangerment of human forces. The AI, however, redesigned it to use decommissioned Barges and be piloted entirely by itself. Despite continued reluctance from high command to use the design, the AI became obsessively devoted to piloting itself to death for the fleet, and high command relented.
\"The AI pilot seems extremely disappointed every time they successfully detonate a Fire Barge, only to subsequently realize they themselves did not die with the ship. I worry about what we've created.\" - Natalia Friedman, Fleet AI Technician."
                                                 
